                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">If this unit is damaged, spend 1 **rage dice**. If your opponent&apos;s **fury level** is lower than yours, they must increase their **fury level** by 1, to a maximum of 7. Then, add 1 to the Rend characteristic of this unit&apos;s non-**^^Companion^^** melee weapons for the rest of the turn.</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"/>
                    <characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"/>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
